<title>UK: LIFFE coffee still up, cocoa and sugar lower PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee still up, cocoa and sugar lower PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Off session highs but still firmer on NY rally, fund buying after friendly GCA data. May up $48 at $1,626 by 1500 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Lower across the board in slow trading. Most active July down eight at 1,017 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Still lower with new spot month August falling 40 cents at $308.20.</p>
</text>
